        "text_cynpJ6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Welcome to Ultimats</h3><p>Ultimats is India’s leading brand of premium floor mats for commercial & home spaces, engineered for superior functional<br/>performance. </p><p>At Ultimats, we specialize in creating bespoke matting products that elevate the aesthetic appeal of your premises. Our strength lies in our passion for innovation and functional design, as each mat is crafted with precision and attention to detail.</p><p>Our manufactured product range includes aluminium entrance mats, commercial barrier matting and dust-control carpet floormats for both outdoor and indoor use.</p><p>Step into a world where form meets function, and every detail reflects uncompromising quality. </p>",
            "font_size": 100,
            "font_type": "body-font"
          }
        },
